OL,3,GNEWSA'Not the answer': Labour MPs speak
OL,4,Aout against Rosebank as decision looms
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome Labour MPs have called on the
OL,7,Fgovernment to reject the Rosebank oil
OL,8,Ffield, saying it is "incompatible" with
OL,9,Fthe UK's climate commitments.
OL,11,FThere is a growing expectation among
OL,12,Fsenior Labour figures that drilling in
OL,13,Fthe oil field off the north-west coast
OL,14,Fof Shetland will be given the go-ahead.
OL,16,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said on
OL,17,FWednesday that a decision would be
OL,18,F"taken in due course" while Energy
OL,19,FSecretary Miatta Fahnbulleh stressed
OL,20,Fthat affordability of energy bills was
OL,21,Fher "overriding objective".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
