OL,3,GNEWSA'Not the answer': Labour MPs speak
OL,4,Aout against Rosebank as decision looms
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in a sign of the division within
OL,7,Fthe party, more than a dozen Labour MPs
OL,8,Fexpressed concerns in Parliament about
OL,9,Fapproving it. Others expressed support,
OL,10,Fpointing to economic benefits.
